            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Airborne 0.3.10

- A cleaner trend map legend, in three aligned groups: Wastewater (Low → High), Outline (rising or falling) and Markers (local area or whole state). The "How to read this map" button is still at the end.
- States with too few wastewater sampling sites now have a light gray fill and a dashed border, and the legend says so ("too few wastewater sites").
- The legend fits small windows without clipping.
]]></description>
